<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Taubman Centers cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Taubman Centers cut.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- PaineWebber downgraded Taubman Centers Inc to neutral from attractive, a PaineWebber source said.</p>
<p>-- Additional details were not immediately available.  </p>
<p>-- PaineWebber later said it downgraded Taubman Centers on valuation.</p>
<p>-- said maintained its 1997 funds from operations estimate of $1.05 per share and the 1998 estimate of $1.13 a share.</p>
<p>-- set a 12-month price target of $14 a share.</p>
<p>-- Taubman lost 1/8 to 13-3/8 in morning trading.</p>
<p>(( -- Wall Street desk 212-859-1730))</p>
</text>
